A||||2||ChadMan||A very smart groundhog||||10||
Z||000000||ChadMan||03-23-2000||08:15 AM||||I was driving down a twisty two-lane road at about 55 mph last night around dusk.  I came around a corner and there was a groundhog in the middle of the road, sitting up looking at me.  I realized there was no way I could stop before hitting him and there was traffic in the oncoming lane, so I didn't even bother swerving or lifting off the gas.<P>To my amazement, this little groundhog immediately flattened himself down on the road!  "HIT THE DECK!"  I passed over him and listened for the telltale "THUMP" but it never came.<P>I looked in my rearview mirror and saw him jump up and hi-tail it for the side of the road.  I'm amazed b/c my car has 4" of ground clearance at most!<P>Now who ever heard of a groundhog that was smart enough to duck?||||reg||10
Z||000001||87ECO5||03-23-2000||08:30 AM||||It always makes my day when I can save an animal from being roadkill!<P>You made my day, Chad.  Thank you!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||03-23-2000||01:33 PM||||Yeah...who knew groundhogs could limbo ?||||reg||1
